WEBVTT

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:21.750
This is terrible!

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.250
What's gonna happen to us?

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:29.170
I'm not afraid.

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:31.010
Come on, guys, get a hold of yourselves!

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.720
It won't be long before my big brother...

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:35.340
...before GGG comes to save us!

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:36.340
Right!

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.510
Hana, try to be strong.

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:40.930
Okay, as long as I have you.

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:44.940
As long as we all have each other there's nothing to be afraid of, right?

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:48.770
Hey, what's that over there?

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:09.420
GaoGaiGar!

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:13.170
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:16.070
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:23.020
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:27.070
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:33.790
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:38.070
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:42.990
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:46.910
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:49.710
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:53.470
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:58.470
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:01.640
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:04.180
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:07.310
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:10.270
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:14.350
Dividing Driver!

00:02:16.170 --> 00:02:21.990
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:27.870
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:30.820
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:34.710
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:36.710
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:39.050
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:42.140
Collision! The Four Machine Kings

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:45.470
<i>Collision! The Four Machine Kings</i>

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:52.940
The Zonderians have exhausted their supply of Zonder Metal.

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:54.770
In order to build a Zonder Metal Plant...

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:58.360
...they have sealed off the city of Tokyo with a Contra Fall.

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:01.610
GGG has launched a joint attack...

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:06.080
...that succeeded in sending GaoGaiGar inside the Contra Fall.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.660
But the Zonderians' assault shows no sign of letting up.

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.750
Can our heroic Ultimate Brave Robot Brigade...

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:16.670
...somehow stop the Four Machine Kings?

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:20.090
All communication with GaoGaiGar remains cut off.

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:23.800
ChoRyuJin is currently in battle with EI-26 in the Hatsudai area.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:30.640
Volfogg is still battling EI-27 in the Underground Water Vein.

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:37.530
So it's all up to GaoGaiGar now that he's infiltrated the Contra Fall?

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:40.900
What other option do we have but to believe in our brave heroes?

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:43.280
The Amphibious Maintenance Vehicle is about to begin...

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:45.200
...the retrieval process for Mic.

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:57.590
Following that, we're sending it to retrieve the Pliers.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.210
Message from Dr. Liger!

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:02.760
Howdy, folks! Somehow I'm back here again!

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:06.720
Eh? Big Brother, we're in a crisis here, what could you possibly want?

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.010
Eh?

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:11.480
Are you sure you want to take that tone with moi?

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:16.060
When I've come this far to bring you the brightest star for mankind?

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:19.940
I'll be there in about 5 minutes, so get ready to receive us!

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:24.410
Main Order Room! Mikoto!

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.280
Just as I thought, I've lost contact.

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:29.120
That Zonder Metal Plant...

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:31.950
...if I can just destroy the energy source that's cultivating the Zonders!

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:40.760
That's it, huh?

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:44.050
So they're using the Loop Line and the rotary highway.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:47.430
Seems they're generating accelerated energy like they did at Isolde!

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:54.440
If they turn everybody in Tokyo into Zonders...

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:57.100
...GGG won't be able to stop them, even if we attack at full strength!

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:58.980
I'm going to destroy it no matter what!

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:10.160
All right!

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:13.500
Goldion Hammer!

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.130
GaoGaiGar!

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:24.800
How dare you enter our plant!

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:54.700
Oh, yay! They did it, everybody!

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:57.460
The Contra Fall has been extinguished.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.040
Huh! What's that?

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:11.890
So that's the Zonder Metal Plant, eh?

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:15.890
And it's in pretty much the final stages of completion.

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:20.350
Chief! We're going to have to cut off the energy supply immediately!

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:25.230
I'm ordering you all to destroy that Zonder Metal Plant!

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:33.370
Amphibious Armored Maintenance Vehicle, docking complete!

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.370
We're now performing...

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:38.540
...emergency maintenance on Mic and the Pliers in the Maintenance Room.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.880
All right! Now, then... why don't we start the operation?

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.500
Leo, I'm gonna borrow Swan for a bit.

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:47.920
What? Me?

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:49.760
Of course!

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:01.100
How dare you, GaoGaiGar!

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:05.070
Come back here!

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:10.950
I never thought that barrier would be breached!

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:13.410
"Destroy the Zonder Metal Plant"...

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:16.910
...and "Protect Special Agent Mamoru". Those are the orders I received.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:19.000
I am no longer available to engage you in battle.

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:26.960
Always, always, always, getting in my way...

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:30.130
...I'll never get over my hatred towards you!

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.590
Today's the day that I'm going to vaporize you!

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:53.490
Sorry, but I'm not about to give you time to regenerate!

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:58.080
I won't let you get away with that!

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.080
I'll take care of him.

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:07.130
Just focus on getting that Zonder Metal Plant done!

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:09.000
We don't need you to tell us!

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.470
I assure you, we're on it!

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.200
What's the situation with the Zonder Metal?

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:44.500
No good. We can't stop the cultivation process.

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:47.330
I'm picking up traces of Elementary Particle Z0.

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:49.880
That's a sure sign that the plant is nearing completion.

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:52.970
I'm estimating we have 10 minutes before it reaches the final stages.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:55.890
So it's a race against time?

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:07.730
Goldymarg!

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:12.030
You don't have a chance of keeping up with him if we're combined, right?

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:15.400
Are you ready to die, GaoGaiGar?

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:20.870
Don't mess with me!

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:27.080
The Deadly Art of the Body-split!

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:51.570
Double Boomerang!

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:59.280
Silver Cross!

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:15.380
Curses!

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:26.930
All crew evacuate! All crew evacuate!

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:34.980
Multidimensional Intelligence Ship, separate and launch!

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:39.660
Volfogg's communicating by remote control!

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:43.990
Right. Entohji, I want you to provide him with as much backup as possible.

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:44.660
Yes, sir.

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:00.430
Just hold on, Volfogg.

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:04.140
I'm going to crunch the numbers to give you the best possible timing.

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:07.020
How about the Mobile Unit?

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:10.900
ChoRyuJin is now approaching the Rotary Highway Zonderians.

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:14.110
GaoGaiGar is now in mid-air battle with the HST Zonderian.

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:17.030
We've got to hurry, or the plant will be completed.

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:19.150
10 million citizens will be...

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:21.530
...Zonderized!

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:41.550
My little Mamoru...

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:43.050
Hey!

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:45.850
Ai, get a hold of yourself.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:47.680
Isamu...

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:58.360
Pizza!

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:01.530
We're gonna fight one-on-one. I'm finally gonna put an end to this!

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:04.910
So at last the day has come when I can step on your neck!

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:06.450
GaoGaiGar!

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:10.870
You can't possibly surpass me in terms of speed.

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:12.370
Don't give me that!

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:17.090
Too slow, too slow!

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:27.930
Your struggles are futile.

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:34.060
I live in the sky, I was raised in the sky. You don't stand a chance against me!

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:40.730
Protect Shade!

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:43.740
Hmph! Ineffective!

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:56.880
Broken Magnum!

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:01.960
The sky is divine.

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:11.470
Air turbulence?

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:12.770
I get it...

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:14.480
That land uplift is causing wind gusts...

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:17.270
...between the buildings that are dozens of times stronger than normal!

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:21.440
GaoGaiGar, I'm going to put an end to our contest right now!

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:30.330
Double Gun!

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:34.960
Mere child's play...

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:48.430
No! The Zonder Metal Plant's almost complete.

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:50.640
Th-There's no time to lose!

00:13:56.980 --> 00:14:00.020
Oh, no! They're really struggling!

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:02.190
What's gonna happen to us all?

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:05.150
If you're gonna whine and moan about it, why don't you go into battle, too?

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:06.530
That's harsh...

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:10.320
Hey, guys, let's all show our support for the GGG robots!

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:11.450
That's a good idea!

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:13.160
Give it all you've got!

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:31.050
At last I can get my revenge for all the grief you've caused me until now!

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:48.650
You fool!

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:53.410
Any mecha that doesn't have a G-Stone is fair game for me to absorb!

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.330
So you fell for it...

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:03.210
What's this? My body's burning!

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:08.920
The Multidimensional Intelligence Ship... Our last ace-in-the-hole!

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:11.890
Let's see you take this, Zonderians!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:15.510
All hands, evacuate!

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:21.600
What have you done? I'm bringing you down with me!

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:24.110
If it means you'll be destroyed, I'll be glad to!

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:30.740
I won't let you escape!

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:52.220
I am leaving the rest to you all...

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:55.550
EI-27 has been annihilated.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:56.640
What about Volfogg?

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:59.430
Communications... have been cut off.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:10.940
You're not fleeing at a time like this, are you?

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:12.530
I'm right behind you!

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:18.490
This is the moment I've been waiting for!

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:20.790
Who knew he'd use the air turbulence?

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:26.500
You're not the only one who put his life on the line for the sky!

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:32.130
So you actually detonated your right arm inside me!

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:36.010
With all your speed, you still couldn't evade me at this distance!

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:39.600
All right, GaoGaiGar!

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:41.520
I was getting old waiting for you!

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:44.350
System Change!

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:48.150
I'm counting on you, Goldy!

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:56.530
Hammer Connect!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:05.040
Goldion Hammer!

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:10.340
Take that!

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:17.050
Hey, Pizza!

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:19.760
Transform into light!

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:38.530
We did it!

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:41.410
But I can't move now, either.

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:47.040
Those three consecutive Goldion Hammers sure took a toll on me.

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:50.380
I'm totally out of energy now.

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:02.890
I can feel it.

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:05.560
The energy from Polonaise and I...

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:09.100
...is cultivating Zonder Metal...

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:17.780
You ugly robot...

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:19.950
I'll be happy to smash you to bits.

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:21.410
All right, come on!

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:29.420
Now!

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:51.150
All of the Zonderian robots have been nullified.

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:54.780
I can confirm that the energy supply to the Zonder Metal Plant has been cut off.

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:56.440
I'm accessing the Mobile Unit now.

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:57.780
Brilliant...

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:00.160
You've done a fine job, Brave Robots!

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:03.120
So he did it? ChoRyuJin...

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:08.330
I can't take another step...

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:15.670
Huh?

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:18.590
O, you weak-willed souls...

00:19:18.670 --> 00:19:22.260
...I see that the time has come for me to grant you my power.

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:31.900
I'm picking up a signal, it's the Elementary Particle Z0!

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:35.440
This isn't good!

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:40.030
Impossible! How can this be?

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:46.370
We Zonderians are blessed with invulnerable bodies.

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:48.660
Although I must admit I'm hurting.

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:53.960
I no longer have enough energy to return to my whole form.

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:57.840
You're sublime... red-and-blue robot...

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:01.090
...so sublime that it makes me want to kill you!

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:05.680
Stop it right now, Primarda!

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:12.980
Primarda!

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:15.810
What's going on?

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:19.570
My darling...

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:31.500
Primarda, you foolish woman...

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:39.380
What on earth was that? What just happened?

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:44.220
Unprecedented amounts of Elementary Particle Z0 are being detected!

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:46.760
Zonder Metal has been created all throughout the capital!

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:49.180
10 million people have been Zonderized?

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:57.520
I'm not there yet. I can sense it further down.

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:03.740
Huh? What are you doing here?

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:06.110
I've got to... I've got to Purify him!

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:08.580
P-Please, wait a minute!

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:12.120
Curatio!

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:14.040
Teneritas!

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:15.670
Sectio!

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:17.420
Salus!

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:19.290
Coctura!

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:29.760
Thank you, my boy. But I'm afraid you were a bit too late.

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:32.180
My body can no longer...

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:37.770
He disappeared!

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:43.440
Yay!

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:49.990
Mankind still has one last hope!

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:51.950
We've still got Mic, remember?

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:54.790
System Change!

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:08.300
Mic Sounders the 13th!

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:12.100
Awesome, baby!

00:22:12.680 --> 00:22:14.310
Come on! Rock 'n' roll!

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:16.310
Disc X!

00:22:17.520 --> 00:22:18.730
Set on!

00:22:22.360 --> 00:22:24.820
Razzle-Dazzle Double V!

00:22:27.360 --> 00:22:31.700
Mic Sounders the 13th's true power has just been released.

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:35.450
Now that the 10 million citizens of this city are about to be Zonderized...

00:22:35.540 --> 00:22:39.460
...who can say whether mankind will see another day?

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:41.000
Mic?

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:50.310
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:55.180
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:01.360
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:06.150
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:10.320
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:17.250
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:24.010
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:28.670
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:34.010
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:40.910
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:48.440
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.690 --> 00:23:50.780
The end is near for all of mankind.

00:23:51.070 --> 00:23:53.620
Will Mic Sounders the 13th get there in time?

00:23:53.700 --> 00:23:56.240
Mamoru and Pasdar, their fateful encounter...

00:23:56.370 --> 00:23:58.870
Pizza bars the way with every last ounce of his strength.

00:23:59.410 --> 00:24:01.870
And Cyborg Gai uses what little energy he has left!

00:24:01.960 --> 00:24:03.630
Who will be the one to survive?

00:24:03.710 --> 00:24:05.630
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:05.670 --> 00:24:06.710
"The Phoenix"

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:06.670
The Phoenix

00:24:07.050 --> 00:24:10.470
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:15.430
Hyper Guy

00:24:13.300 --> 00:24:14.930
This is the Key to Victory!
